{"data":{"body":"**P2 \u2014 Stop draining completions after enclosing spans end.** If `onOperationChange` arrives while this final flush is blocked, this call emits the operation span after its Invocation or terminal Workflow parent has ended, producing invalid span boundaries. Reach completion quiescence before ending the parents, then perform only a provider flush here. Apply the same ordering to `InvocationOtelPlugin` and add a blocked-final-flush containment test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPenXVs77tBQI","finding_digest":"5485c6f5c7a060fb823ae9bd47d5197106c6aca5c4ebec01884e70c5887626b9","finding_id":"arf_v1_ksc4n5ohubqpxar25g6upvizoe","finding_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-otel/src/execution-plugin.ts::oninvocationend::late-completion-outside-invocation-boundary","identity_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-otel/src/execution-plugin.ts::oninvocationend::late-completion-outside-invocation-boundary","line":414,"observation_digest":"48b098ed9f5d529108b2ea2bd13e15f4a70cfa1e2e66925b2735931c9087fb37","observation_id":"aro_v1_jcyjr3m7lvjjccfs5iv5cpqv6s","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-otel/src/execution-plugin.ts","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_ksc4n5ohubqpxar25g6upvizoe","published_at":"2026-10-08T18:47:42Z","review_id":"arr_v1_h5fskves4siyuwbzpvkgzg7ivv","reviewed_base_sha":"cc7da9aaa2da8fdc6fc9b0d31c7b74ff1c2eb382","reviewed_head_sha":"3b91b1f19c3ada0a2b8f8d997d706a0df09f1714","reviewer":"codex","start_line":414,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":924},"record_id":"art_v1_gkgwqkjh5zkjzccya7c7pakcze","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T18:47:42Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js","id":1038735190},"schema_version":1}
